xrgvVwAOxrvKmhorkjtHdU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9TPmtA-Bhr4LXOXJ24CULbk0CBtvvcJktapXljOsSzMA&oe=6A3D36FE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Paint The Silence - A Visual Music Album", "keywords": ["music", "360", "videos", "immersive", "concert"], "long_description": "## \ud83c\udfa7 Your VR Music Library by Carrie Able\n\nStep into a new way of experiencing music. With Carrie Able, you can explore and watch immersive **VR music videos and performances**, placing you right at the center of the scene.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfa5 Immersive Content\n- 360\u00b0 music videos  \n- Engaging live performances  \n- Smooth and optimized VR playback  \n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udded Simple & Intuitive Navigation\n- Browse content by title or artist  \n- Clean, easy-to-use interface  \n- Quick access to your favorite videos  \n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Optimized for VR\n- Fast content loading  \n- Stable playback experience  \n- Designed specifically for VR headsets  \n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udf0c Experience Music Differently\nThis isn\u2019t just listening \u2014 it\u2019s being there.  \nChoose a video, put on your headset, and dive into the world of music with Carrie Able.", "short_description": "Explore immersive VR music videos and performances with Carrie Able. Browse content, discover artists, and enjoy a smooth, engaging 360\u00b0 experience. Step inside the music and experience it like never before."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://carrieable.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Carrie Able", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://carrieable.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "